</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Can AEO replace traditional content marketing entirely?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">AEO works best as a complement to traditional content marketing rather than a complete replacement. While AEO optimizes for AI engine visibility, traditional content marketing remains valuable for brand building, lead nurturing, and direct website engagement.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How quickly can businesses see results from AEO compared to traditional content marketing?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">AEO typically requires a longer-term approach to show measurable results compared to traditional content marketing. While traditional content can generate immediate traffic and engagement, AEO focuses on building cumulative authority and positioning across AI engines over time.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Do the same content creation skills apply to both approaches?</h3>
