</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What types of businesses benefit most from AEO versus traditional content marketing?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Businesses in competitive markets where AI engines frequently generate responses about their industry benefit most from AEO. Traditional content marketing remains effective for brand awareness and relationship building across all business types.</p>
